            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Confira os feedbacks e avaliações enviadas por clientes atendidos (dados confidenciais foram tarjados):</p>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                <div class="bg-gray-900 p-4 rounded-lg border border-gray-800 space-y-2">
                    <div class="h-40 bg-gray-950 border border-dashed border-gray-800 rounded flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center p-4">
                        <i data-lucide="image" class="w-8 h-8 text-gray-600 mb-2"></i>
                        <span class="text-xs text-gray-500">Print do Feedback de Caso Encerrado</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-300 font-bold">Investigação de Golpe Financeiro</p>
                    <span class="text-[10px] text-emerald-400 font-mono">✔ Ativo Rastreado com Sucesso</span>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-gray-900 p-4 rounded-lg border border-gray-800 space-y-2">
                    <div class="h-40 bg-gray-950 border border-dashed border-gray-800 rounded flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center p-4">
                        <i data-lucide="image" class="w-8 h-8 text-gray-600 mb-2"></i>
                        <span class="text-xs text-gray-500">Print do Feedback de Perfil Falso</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-300 font-bold">Identificação de Assédio/Fake</p>
                    <span class="text-[10px] text-emerald-400 font-mono">✔ Autoria Identificada</span>
